          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0055/5525/7462/files/Link_-_1.jpg?v=1647847679">
          <h3 class="head">Fashionable </h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="back">
        <div class="back-content">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0055/5525/7462/files/Link_-_1.jpg?v=1647847679">
          <h3 class="head">Fashionable </h3>
          <p>From the runaway to the roads, our shoes are all the range among consumers from all walks of life. We do not follow trends.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="Grid__Cell 1/2--phone 1/4--lap-and-up about-section">
      <div class="front">
        <div class="fron-content">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0055/5525/7462/files/Link_-_2.jpg?v=1647847679">
          <h3 class="head">Accepted globally</h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="back">
        <div class="back-content">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0055/5525/7462/files/Link_-_2.jpg?v=1647847679">
          <h3 class="head">Accepted globally</h3>
          <p>We are loved locally, but also quite famous internationally. We make up 50% of Pakistan’s entire footwear export, helping the economy grow as we do.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="Grid__Cell 1/2--phone 1/4--lap-and-up about-section">
      <div class="front">
        <div class="front-content">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0055/5525/7462/files/Link_-_3.jpg?v=1647847679">
          <h3 class="head">Time's Tested </h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="back">
        <div class="back-content">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0055/5525/7462/files/Link_-_3.jpg?v=1647847679">
          <h3 class="head">Time's Tested </h3>
          <p>Ever since it’s inception in 1941, Service Group has served the nation with quality and innovation. We didn’t just master the game, we helped make it what it is today.</p>
